<DIV class="neirong">

<div class="neirong-bt">【学在西电】比亚迪杯西安电子科技大学第46届运动会落幕</div>

<DIV id="wz_info" class="b_b">

<span id="date">发布时间：2026-04-30 11:22:06</span><span id="from">来源：体育部</span><span id="from">点击：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1271716923, 296166)</script></span><span style="margin-left:10px;display: none;"><a href="http://news.xidian.edu.cn/info/2106/296166.htm#A" style="color: #bd0800;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;">我要评论:</FONT></span></a></span>
 <SPAN style="display: none;">（<A class="zhijiedaopinglun" href="javascript:void(0)"><FONT style="font-weight: bold"></FONT></A>） </SPAN> 
<DIV id="f_size"><A id="small" href="javascript:decreaseFontSize();">&nbsp;T&nbsp;</A>|<A id="big" href="javascript:increaseFontSize();">&nbsp;T&nbsp;</A></DIV></DIV>

<form name="_newscontent_fromname">
     <div class="neirong-xian"></div>
    <div id="wz_zw"><div class="v_news_content">
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;"><strong>西电新闻网讯</strong>（通讯员&nbsp;<strong>董颖初</strong>）桃李斗艳，天地争春。4月28日至29日，比亚迪杯西安电子科技大学第四十六届运动会在长安校区北田径场举行。校党委书记任小龙，校长高新波，党委副书记、纪委书记郭俊，副校长朱文凯、刘宏伟，党委常委、党委组织部部长毛立强，党委常委、党委统战部部长、党政办公室主任蔡固顺，比亚迪西北地区人力资源部高级招聘经理李莉，以及学校各分会主席、职能部门负责人齐聚28日上午的开幕式现场。开幕式由郭俊主持，高新波致开幕辞，任小龙宣布开幕。</p> 
  <p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;">两天赛程通过网络视频与图片直播，全程、全方位地展现了西电师生昂扬向上的精神风貌。</p> 
  <p style="text-align:center"><img src="/__local/C/D0/48/8FFA630ED706C3E10D3CA0E07E6_59D8740D_5D9CF.jpg" width="620" title="开幕式1.jpg" word_img="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/CD0488FFA630ED706C3E10D3CA0E07E6/59D8740D/5D9CF" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/0/CF/27/46365D84CF06B619E09A35B3840_0AB5E510_57272C.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align:center"><img src="/__local/F/8E/B1/3248A2FA0ECA96274446AD93479_45A63706_64AAF.jpg" width="620" title="开幕式3.jpg" word_img="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/F8EB13248A2FA0ECA96274446AD93479/45A63706/64AAF" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/1/C3/DB/2865EA5428831008146F655948B_8DBDF89A_6007DD.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/1/B8/98/1A0A845299EC2C9A2AFCB81201E_CA2440CA_39277.jpg" width="620" title="20106645.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/1B8981A0A845299EC2C9A2AFCB81201E/CA2440CA/39277" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/0/54/D2/5123E463235405201C65669FE28_0B67B399_D6A96.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/1/18/0E/EE34ACA27BFBFE101A9A38A6E47_18C88590_36B17.jpg" width="620" title="20626535.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/1180EEE34ACA27BFBFE101A9A38A6E47/18C88590/36B17" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/2/2C/D4/8853018F8E28D3D358CD21B81DE_31AB5D62_D463A.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/A/CA/EC/9C5BA4F095DEEE71AC375869356_6F144520_2F696.jpg" width="620" title="21860306.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/ACAEC9C5BA4F095DEEE71AC375869356/6F144520/2F696" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/9/49/B5/CFCFDA5F8947B4B34E38741CE91_922185A3_BD649.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 40px;"><strong>展演纷呈，赓续红色文脉</strong></p> 
  <p style="text-indent: 2.1563em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify; line-height: 2em;">开幕式上，学校二十七个方阵整齐列队入场。新组建的舞龙舞狮队拉开文艺表演序幕：金龙由西电中华健儿舞动，传承千年文脉；粉龙由西电留学生舞动，汇聚五洲风采。龙腾狮跃、气势昂扬，尽显青春活力与包容格局。</p> 
  <p style="text-indent: 2.1563em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: justify; line-height: 2em;">“赓续红色血脉，智造时代华章”为主题的文艺表演汇聚四个篇章：《乘风破浪》篇章中，400名男生手持旗帜舞动，重现西电以电波铸剑、丹心报国的峥嵘校史；400名女生在《花开中国》篇章里裙袂翩跹，共绘山河；《智造未来》篇章中，男生们以蓝银矩阵造型创意排布，彰显西电以科技为翼逐梦远航的奋进力量；终章《我们的新时代》全员集结登场，共同托举巨幅五星红旗，铿锵姿态诠释新时代青年勇担使命、奔赴复兴征程的坚定信念。</p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/6/B2/07/C1926C70259323F4E1F8F11F87C_EA0D8807_4D628.jpg" width="620" title="表演1.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/6B207C1926C70259323F4E1F8F11F87C/EA0D8807/4D628" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/1/AD/49/F64AB4DF2B2979568FCC4E67BE7_A8FA9451_4B0BFC.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/6/56/7C/8E96CDA879342BC83394E450349_918898FD_5DB7F.jpg" width="620" title="2.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/6567C8E96CDA879342BC83394E450349/918898FD/5DB7F" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/D/0E/62/565954330FCAAE4850F76C5A283_BC5F0FDA_5A3D17.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/B/49/2B/FAD57F6A71756C85B933A792DD6_358994E7_5BB9C.jpg" width="620" title="1.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/B492BFAD57F6A71756C85B933A792DD6/358994E7/5BB9C" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/E/AC/1B/61E6C0DE38E48CD94B96F0ED4A7_77A44F0D_A6F291.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p><img src="/__local/0/EC/A2/1B4323701BF0D4F4A04794CB77C_F8628820_5CE86.jpg" width="620" title="表演3.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/0ECA21B4323701BF0D4F4A04794CB77C/F8628820/5CE86" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/3/26/C1/01D9C732F5DA5EB26A0587D05F1_66DAF7E0_435C7D.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p><img src="/__local/A/95/52/82F745D86DB2DABBD67C968E581_973B52C1_4F355.jpg" width="620" title="50917043.jpg" word_img="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/A955282F745D86DB2DABBD67C968E581/973B52C1/4F355" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/1/22/4B/A8C33C076F931613F12365726E3_278CC0D2_C3EFF.jpg" class="img_vsb_content" style="text-align: center; white-space: normal;"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/F/1F/2B/23D592BF174C3E29521197DEF1A_E401AB7B_32DD9.jpg" width="620" title="41766080.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/F1F2B23D592BF174C3E29521197DEF1A/E401AB7B/32DD9" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/3/B5/87/018FA287A1C70CCC9971AB26C0E_DF6E0F12_10E977.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;"><strong>驰骋赛场，凝聚奋进力量</strong></p> 
  <p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;">赛事为期两日，规模盛大、参与广泛。本次运动会共设21个学生组别、27支教职工代表队，5561名运动员同台竞技，200余名裁判员、志愿者全程保驾护航。团操彩排、现场观众，总人数超11,000人。赛场之上，短跑冲刺、长跑耐力、田赛角逐激烈上演；红色集体项目让师生沉浸式重温革命岁月，在协作比拼中凝聚集体力量，引导师生厚植家国情怀，传承西电红色基因与奋斗底色；校园趣味挑战活动同步开展，全员踊跃参与，在自我超越中焕发校园活力。</p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/4/4F/4F/C9236411EE9E40F6E1EE91C5E5D_41087DBD_7D4A5.jpg" width="620" title="赛场1.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/44F4FC9236411EE9E40F6E1EE91C5E5D/41087DBD/7D4A5" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/4/A0/DE/BA1A678C43F4D232A7FD9431629_6ADE42EF_609302.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p><img src="/__local/9/3B/B7/2A162C00586056506B50887D720_6CFC5F49_45F5D.jpg" width="620" title="赛场2.jpg" word_img="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/93BB72A162C00586056506B50887D720/6CFC5F49/45F5D" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/5/E4/89/3F25FD287B791D5B4CD95B9ABF5_687B04C4_4DA649.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;">两天里，西电师生迸发出无限的青春力量，取得了精神文明和运动成绩的双丰收：共3人次打破3项校记录，8人次打破7项校运会记录，其中许博洋、苏晨珺两位同学均在本届运动会中两次刷新纪录。</p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/3/53/B5/CBAA5E61915E8AC96D3B204053D_53166D15_9BAA4.jpg" width="620" title="赛场3.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/353B5CBAA5E61915E8AC96D3B204053D/53166D15/9BAA4" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/5/FD/EA/7E7A159B23CA7F92FED5C9BA3E3_659E1DD9_4E2480.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/B/FD/79/986658BDABF6A031341FC30BD6A_586E571B_469EB.jpg" width="620" title="赛场4.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/BFD79986658BDABF6A031341FC30BD6A/586E571B/469EB" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/E/3B/5D/69191003765FA0DCAEF45DF34D4_F01B94EF_43FF17.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align:center"><img src="/__local/A/53/B1/B1E6F60ED11844A3C48F65A0F00_F611027D_70619.jpg" width="620" title="赛场7.jpg" word_img="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/A53B1B1E6F60ED11844A3C48F65A0F00/F611027D/70619" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/7/7D/9D/78654743475A2EDD6F1B484BCEA_CAF86825_5AC3CA.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;">最终，<span class="" link-id="link-1777517896160-0.7135546760417333">新生书院</span>、电子工程学院、通信工程学院、集成电路学部、计算机科学与技术学院、人工智能学院获得学生组团体总分1-6名；基础教育管理办公室、机关、通信工程学院、本科生院、经济与管理学院、电子工程学院获得教工组团体总分1-6名。数学与统计学院等3个单位获得“体育道德风尚奖”，机关等3个单位获得“优秀组织奖”，机电工程学院等3个学院获得“最佳参与奖”。<br></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/8/13/24/6D0C21F618227738C49BC4BD816_5A29E62A_C697.png" width="620" title="微信图片_2026-04-30_110342_537.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/813246D0C21F618227738C49BC4BD816/5A29E62A/C697" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/8/13/24/6D0C21F618227738C49BC4BD816_5A29E62A_C697.png" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/A/4F/34/4380226E9587F9B49C21D59D616_5CF44C76_C391.png" width="620" title="微信图片_2026-04-30_110349_555.png" word_img="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/A4F344380226E9587F9B49C21D59D616/5CF44C76/C391" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/A/4F/34/4380226E9587F9B49C21D59D616_5CF44C76_C391.png" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/3/A3/04/E831C1152F81096F7F3B8BC45A9_60A7B71D_4F57.png" width="620" title="微信图片_2026-04-30_110624_182.png" word_img="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/3A304E831C1152F81096F7F3B8BC45A9/60A7B71D/4F57" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/4/24/4D/2CCD6A1D3357F91B73435E85930_2EE5238C_F5B3.png" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
