  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/4/5B/A5/B3B3C2D927B5AFC41E26BC9ED08_93C6D8C2_4A8BC.jpg" width="620" title="颁奖3.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/45BA5B3B3C2D927B5AFC41E26BC9ED08/93C6D8C2/4A8BC" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/8/C3/ED/DD92157128E4E1F1CBDCA65A67D_38184B64_3F7C12.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/5/C4/F0/8D913FE7DA34AC091E7BA9B01A1_54A0CC42_4E394.jpg" width="620" title="颁奖4.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/5C4F08D913FE7DA34AC091E7BA9B01A1/54A0CC42/4E394" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/E/7B/41/D43143E90F5BD228AC163071D1E_8527258F_26E9AD.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/5/ED/B2/BB8448092690E9B771045319109_00855197_4C795.jpg" width="620" title="颁奖5.jpg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/5EDB2BB8448092690E9B771045319109/00855197/4C795" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/6/CD/3C/E552AE6FB67831DD4B6A5A641D3_954A9094_40E167.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;"><strong>全域传播，彰显西电风貌</strong></p> 
  <p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;">本次运动会依托校园公众号提前预热，全程线上直播，打破空间限制，收获广泛关注与热烈好评。据统计，全媒体视频及图片直播累计观看人次突破百万，广大校友留言点赞。</p> 
  <p style="text-align:center"><img src="/__local/4/EA/4B/D84F7136C926F21460F81B25A5E_3D938D49_79DCB.jpg" width="620" title="3.jpg" word_img="" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/4EA4BD84F7136C926F21460F81B25A5E/3D938D49/79DCB" vheight="" vwidth="620" orisrc="/__local/5/49/7C/46AA86B6C4E7B17DBEDCF95BAE2_29848580_42B140.jpg" class="img_vsb_content" style="text-align: center; white-space: normal;"></p> 
  <p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em;">本次盛会不仅丰富了校园体育文化生活，更成为对外展示西电办学风采、精神底蕴与青春活力的重要窗口。</p> 
  <p style="text-align: center"><br></p> 
  <p><br></p>
</div></div><div class="editor">责任编辑：唐羽琴</div>
